config BT_HIDP
	tristate "HIDP protocol support"
	depends on BT_BREDR && INPUT
	select HID
	help
	  HIDP (Human Interface Device Protocol) is a transport layer
	  for HID reports.  HIDP is required for the Bluetooth Human
	  Interface Device Profile.
